RES osdtriplet
! Batch 3: tilt and decenter commands with RSI/FIR verification
STILT 2 0.5 0 0
RSI f1 w1 0.0 0.7
RES osdtriplet
BTILT 2 4 0.5 0 0
FIR
RES osdtriplet
! ROLL: start surf must have finite thickness predecessor; use surf 2
ROLL 2 4 0.1 0
RSI f1 w1 0.0 0.7
RES osdtriplet
! DISP: start surf must have finite thickness predecessor; use surf 2
DISP 2 4 0.1 0 0
FIR
RES osdtriplet
PIVAXIS ALL
! ---- CODE V tilt/decenter commands, saved and restored ----
! YDE must move the ray in Y (X and Y decenters were swapped after EOS).
RES osdtriplet
YDE S2 1
RSI f1 w1 0 0
! Every decenter type and value; the save writes them as CODE V lines and
! the restored lens must trace identically.
RES osdtriplet
YDE S2 0.3
XDE S2 -0.1
ADE S2 1.5
BDE S2 0.25
CDE S2 3
DAR S4
YDE S4 0.2
ADE S4 -0.7
ZDE S5 0.05
BDE S5 0.4
YOD S5 1.5
REV S6
YDE S6 0.1
YDE SI 0.05
ADE SI 1
RSI f2 w1 0.3 0.7
SAV tdsave
PRT tdsave
RES tdsave
RSI f2 w1 0.3 0.7
! RET, and the DISP construct (return + global offset)
RES osdtriplet
ADE S2 2
YDE S2 0.4
RET S4 S2
RSI f2 w1 0 0.7
SAV tdret
PRT tdret
RES tdret
RSI f2 w1 0 0.7
RES osdtriplet
DISP 2 4 0.1 0 0
RSI f2 w1 0 0.7
SAV tddisp
RES tddisp
RSI f2 w1 0 0.7
! DEL DAR keeps the values; DEL DDA removes them
RES osdtriplet
DAR S4
ADE S4 1
YDE S4 0.2
REV S5
BDE S5 0.3
DEL DAR S4
DEL DDA S5
SAV tddel
PRT tddel
! Errors
XDE
XDE S99 1
XDE S2 abc
RET S3 S1..2
DEL DDA
